	"Description": "The base file for this mod shall contain the code needed for the mod and I will publish assets for each pet, with maybe a blurb about the pet\n<br />\n<br />Disclaimer?\n<br />I'm pretty new to coding and only have used\u00A0pixel art a few times in the past but I am willing to give pretty much any animal a shot and I will hopefully learn throughout this project! But that by no means that I will not try my best at each piece I do. As a side note,\u00A0I am a full-time college student and I work in a preschool and have to a ton of observations and other stuff,\u00A0so I might have slower days when it comes to progress but I will force my Adhd pea brain to charge ahead.\n<br />\n<br />Links:\u00A0\n<br />[url=https://ko-fi.com/pixelateyourpets]Ko-Fi[/url]\u00A0-- You can donate if you want to and are in a position to, or you can just drop by to say hello with your reference pictures, since my mod is free and so is the page! :)",
